  "description": "\"Nice to meet you. I am Kang Hajin, and starting today, I will be serving as the Head of the Overseas Sales Department.\"   \nThe man she thought she would never see again after a one-night stand with her first love ten years ago had reappeared as the one in control. \n\"You absolutely cannot date me, and I don't have the confidence to treat you merely as a subordinate.\"   \n\"Then there is only one answer. We have no choice but to be partners.\"   \nWatching the corners of Hajin's eyes curve softly, Jihye instinctively knew. That, after ten years, a massive ordeal named 'Kang Hajin' had once again intruded into her life.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59827673), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B0%91%EC%9D%98-%EC%88%9C%EC%A0%95/3123)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/132162)",
